<title>USA: Pillowtex Corp unit buys warehouse.</title>
<headline>Pillowtex Corp unit buys warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pillowtex Corp said Tuesday that its subsidiary, Beacon Manufacturing Co, completed the purchase of a 746,600 square foot warehouse facility in Mauldin, S.C., for about $8.35 million.</p>
<p>&quot;As we continue to grow the Beacon Division, a new blanket warehouse was key, and, as we begin to service our new Fieldcrest (Cannon Inc ) customers, the timing couldn't be better,&quot; stated Charles Hansen, Pillowtex CEO.</p>
</text>
